---
// Masthead — the home page's title block (design-ref/editorial/home.html).
---

<section class="mast">
  <h1><span>wit,</span><span>et cetera.</span></h1>
  <p class="zh">才智，以及其他。<br />一張永遠沒寫完的清單——<em>程式、文字，et cetera。</em></p>
  <div class="vert">興趣雜得像一張永遠寫不完的清單</div>
</section>

<style>
  .mast {
    position: relative;
    padding: 36px 0 54px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--en);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--fs-mast);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-left: -0.04em;
  }
  h1 span {
    display: block;
  }
  h1 span:last-child {
    padding-left: 1.35em;
  }
  .zh {
    margin-top: 34px;
    max-width: 21em;
    font-family: var(--zh);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--fs-mast-zh);
    line-height: 1.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .zh em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--moss-600);
  }
  .vert {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 44px;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-family: var(--zh);
    font-size: var(--fs-vert);
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: var(--ink-70);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .vert::before {
    content: '';
    width: 1px;
    height: 44px;
    background: var(--moss-600);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .vert {
      display: none;
    }
    .mast {
      padding: 26px 0 40px;
    }
    h1 span:last-child {
      padding-left: 0.6em;
    }
    .zh {
      font-size: var(--fs-mast-zh-m);
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
